     ò*/Title  Proto-Type definition section                                                       Ä
     Ç***êProgram Proto-Type Parameters                                                           Ä
     DParameters       PR                  ExtPgm('EDTSRCR')
     D FileName                      10A
     D Library                       10A
     D Member                        10A
     D Sequence                       6P 2
     D SourceData                   100A
     D Action                         1A

     Ç***êProgram Input Parameters                                                               Ä
     DParameters       PI
     D FileName                      10A
     D Library                       10A
     D Member                        10A
     D Sequence                       6P 2
     D SourceData                   100A
