     ò*/Title  Data definition section                                                             Ä
     Ç***êDefine Program Standalone Fields                                                        Ä
     DCurrDate         S               D   INZ(*JOB)
     DCurrTime         S               D   INZ(*SYS)
     DCommand          S            512A                                        QCMDEXC Command
     DLength           S             15P 5 Inz(%Size(Command))                  QCMDEXC Length
     DError            S               N                                        Error Indicator
     DNextSequence     S                   Like(Sequence)                       Next Sequence Number


     Ç***êDefault Field Overlay Data Structure         Ä
     DOverlays         DS
     D Data                         112A
     D  SRCSEQ                        6S 2 Overlay(Data:1)
     D  SRCDAT                        6S 0 Overlay(Data:7)
     D  SRCDTA                      100A   Overlay(Data:13)

     Ç***êProgram Status Data Structure                                                           Ä
     DProgramStatus   SDS
     D Current                       10A   Overlay(ProgramStatus:1)             Current Program
     D CurrUser                      10A   Overlay(ProgramStatus:254)           Current User
     D WorkStn                       10A   Overlay(ProgramStatus:244)           Work Station

     ISource    NS
     I                                  1  112  Data

