     ò*/Title  Process all one time functions                                                      Ä
     Ç**********************************************************************************Ä
     Ç*****à Subroutine :ö*INZSR                                                  Ç*****Ä
     Ç*****à    Purpose :öProcess all one time functions.                         Ç*****Ä
     Ç**********************************************************************************Ä
     C     *INZSR        BegSr

     C                   Eval      Command =
     C                             'OVRDBF FILE(SOURCE) TOFILE(' +
     C                             %Trim(Library) + '/' +
     C                             %Trim(Filename) + ') MBR(' +
     C                             %Trim(Member) + ') SECURE(*YES) +
     C                             OVRSCOPE(*JOB) SHARE(*YES)'
     Ç***êCall QCMDEXC                                                                           Ä
     C                   CallP(E)  CmdExec(Command:Length)

     C                   Open      Source

     C     *Hival        SetGt(E)  Source
     C                   If        %Error
     C                   Eval      NextSequence = 1
     C                   Else
     C                   ReadP     Source
     C                   If        %Eof
     C                   Eval      NextSequence = 1
     C                   Else
     C                   Eval      NextSequence = SRCSEQ + 1
     C                   EndIf
     C                   EndIf

     C     *MDY          Move      CurrDate      SRCDAT

     C                   EndSR
     Ç**********************************************************************************Ä
     OSource    EADD         AddSrc
     O                       Data               112
     OSource    E            UpdSrc
     O                       Data               112
     OSource    EDEL         DelSrc
